{"seq":1,"slug":"optuna-ax-platform","title":"Optuna 与 Ax 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/optuna-ax-platform","wordCount":1003,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"optuna-与-ax-平台\">Optuna 与 Ax 平台</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Optuna</strong>：轻量级 define-by-run HPO 框架，TPE 默认采样器，v4.9 支持 GP/多目标/GrpcStorageProxy</li>\n<li><strong>Ax/BoTorch</strong>：Meta 的生产级自适应实验平台，GP 默认代理，支持多目标/约束/批量异步</li>\n<li><strong>分层集成</strong>：搜索算法（Optuna/Ax）+ 调度器（ASHA/PBT）+ 执行层（Ray）职责分离</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"两大平台的定位差异\">两大平台的定位差异</h2><p>Optuna 和 Ax 是 2026 年最活跃的开源贝叶斯优化平台，但它们的设计哲学截然不同。Optuna 以&quot;轻量级、Pythonic、define-by-run&quot;为核心追求，让研究者用最少代码就能开始优化；Ax 以&quot;生产级、全栈、自适应实验&quot;为目标，服务于 Meta 内部数千个并发优化任务的规模。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Optuna 4.9 (2026.06)</th>\n<th>Ax 1.3.1 (2026.06)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心团队</td>\n<td>Preferred Networks (日本)</td>\n<td>Meta (美国)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认代理模型</td>\n<td>TPE（密度估计）</td>\n<td>GP via BoTorch（高斯过程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索空间定义</td>\n<td>define-by-run（函数内部 <code>suggest_*</code>）</td>\n<td>declare-then-run（预定义 <code>SearchSpace</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件参数</td>\n<td>Python 条件逻辑天然支持</td>\n<td><code>HierarchicalSearchSpace</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标</td>\n<td>NSGA-II / MOTPE</td>\n<td>qNEHVI（Pareto 超体积）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式</td>\n<td>JournalStorage / GrpcStorageProxy</td>\n<td>Scheduler + Runner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>optuna-dashboard（Web UI）</td>\n<td>Ax Service API + Plotly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展机制</td>\n<td>OptunaHub（社区采样器/剪枝器）</td>\n<td>BoTorch 自定义模型/采集函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产部署</td>\n<td>轻量——嵌入应用代码</td>\n<td>重量——独立调度服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"optuna-核心用法\">Optuna 核心用法</h2><h3 id=\"基本优化循环\">基本优化循环</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import optuna&#10;&#10;def objective(trial):&#10;    lr = trial.suggest_float(&quot;lr&quot;, 1e-5, 1e-1, log=True)&#10;    layers = trial.suggest_int(&quot;layers&quot;, 2, 8)&#10;    dropout = trial.suggest_float(&quot;dropout&quot;, 0.0, 0.5)&#10;&#10;    model = build_model(layers=layers, dropout=dropout)&#10;    val_loss = train_and_evaluate(model, lr=lr)&#10;    return val_loss&#10;&#10;study = optuna.create_study(&#10;    direction=&quot;minimize&quot;,&#10;    sampler=optuna.samplers.TPESampler(multivariate=True),&#10;    pruner=optuna.pruners.HyperbandPruner(min_resource=1, max_resource=100)&#10;)&#10;study.optimize(objective, n_trials=200, n_jobs=4)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> objective</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trial):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_float(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_int(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dropout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial.suggest_float(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dropout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> build_model(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">layers, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dropout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dropout)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    val_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_and_evaluate(model, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val_loss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.create_study(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"minimize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    sampler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optuna.samplers.TPESampler(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">multivariate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    pruner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optuna.pruners.HyperbandPruner(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study.optimize(objective, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_jobs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"进阶功能\">进阶功能</h3><p><strong>多目标优化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"study = optuna.create_study(&#10;    directions=[&quot;minimize&quot;, &quot;minimize&quot;],  # loss, latency&#10;    sampler=optuna.samplers.NSGAIISampler()&#10;)&#10;# 目标函数返回 tuple&#10;def objective(trial):&#10;    # ...&#10;    return val_loss, inference_latency\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.create_study(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    directions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"minimize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"minimize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># loss, latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    sampler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optuna.samplers.NSGAIISampler()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 目标函数返回 tuple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> objective</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trial):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val_loss, inference_latency</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GPSampler</strong>（v4.5+ 新增，对标 Ax/BoTorch 的 GP 路线）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"sampler = optuna.samplers.GPSampler(&#10;    n_startup_trials=10,&#10;    deterministic_objective=False  # 是否假设无噪声&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.samplers.GPSampler(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_startup_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deterministic_objective</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 是否假设无噪声</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>OptunaHub 社区采样器</strong>：通过 <code>optunahub</code> 包访问社区贡献的采样器和剪枝器——包括 CMA-ES、ConfOpt（校准分位数回归代理）、PriorBand 实现等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ax-核心用法\">Ax 核心用法</h2><h3 id=\"service-api-快速上手\">Service API（快速上手）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ax.service.ax_client import AxClient&#10;&#10;ax_client = AxClient()&#10;ax_client.create_experiment(&#10;    parameters=[&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;lr&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;range&quot;, &quot;bounds&quot;: [1e-5, 1e-1], &quot;log_scale&quot;: True},&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;layers&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;range&quot;, &quot;bounds&quot;: [2, 8], &quot;value_type&quot;: &quot;int&quot;},&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;dropout&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;range&quot;, &quot;bounds&quot;: [0.0, 0.5]},&#10;    ],&#10;    objectives={&quot;val_loss&quot;: ObjectiveProperties(minimize=True)},&#10;    outcome_constraints=[&quot;latency &lt;= 50.0&quot;]  # 推理延迟约束&#10;)&#10;&#10;for _ in range(50):&#10;    params, trial_index = ax_client.get_next_trial()&#10;    result = train_and_evaluate(**params)&#10;    ax_client.complete_trial(trial_index, raw_data={&quot;val_loss&quot;: result[&quot;loss&quot;], &quot;latency&quot;: result[&quot;latency&quot;]})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ax.service.ax_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AxClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AxClient()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ax_client.create_experiment(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    parameters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bounds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"log_scale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bounds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"value_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"int\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dropout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bounds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    objectives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"val_loss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ObjectiveProperties(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">minimize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    outcome_constraints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latency &#x3C;= 50.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 推理延迟约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    params, trial_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ax_client.get_next_trial()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_and_evaluate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ax_client.complete_trial(trial_index, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">raw_data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"val_loss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"loss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"developer-api-完全控制\">Developer API（完全控制）</h3><p>Ax 的 Developer API 暴露了完整的 Experiment → GenerationStrategy → Model → Trial 层次结构，允许自定义 BoTorch 模型、采集函数和候选生成逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>GenerationStrategy</strong> 是 Ax 的核心编排概念——定义多阶段搜索策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ax.modelbridge.generation_strategy import GenerationStrategy, GenerationStep&#10;from ax.modelbridge.registry import Models&#10;&#10;gs = GenerationStrategy(steps=[&#10;    GenerationStep(model=Models.SOBOL, num_trials=10),          # 阶段1: Sobol 初始化&#10;    GenerationStep(model=Models.BOTORCH_MODULAR, num_trials=-1) # 阶段2: BO 直到预算用尽&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ax.modelbridge.generation_strategy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GenerationStrategy, GenerationStep</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ax.modelbridge.registry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Models</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GenerationStrategy(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GenerationStep(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Models.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SOBOL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 阶段1: Sobol 初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GenerationStep(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Models.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BOTORCH_MODULAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 阶段2: BO 直到预算用尽</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"botorch-ax-的优化引擎\">BoTorch：Ax 的优化引擎</h2><p>BoTorch 是 Ax 的底层贝叶斯优化库，直接构建在 PyTorch 和 GPyTorch 之上。对需要定制算法的研究者，BoTorch 提供：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可微 MC 采集函数</strong>：q-EI、q-UCB、q-KG、qNEHVI 等的梯度优化</li>\n<li><strong>GPU 加速 GP</strong>：利用 GPyTorch 的 Lanczos/CG 方法处理大规模数据</li>\n<li><strong>TuRBO</strong>：信赖域贝叶斯优化——局部 GP + 动态信赖域</li>\n<li><strong>SAASBO</strong>：稀疏轴对齐子空间 BO——自动处理高维空间</li>\n<li><strong>多保真度 GP</strong>：Multi-task GP 建模不同保真度间的相关性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"平台选择决策树\">平台选择决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{评估次数预算?} --&gt;|&lt; 100 次| B{搜索空间复杂度?}&#10;    A --&gt;|100-1000 次| C{条件/离散参数多?}&#10;    A --&gt;|&gt; 1000 次| D[Optuna TPE&lt;br/&gt;低开销大规模]&#10;    B --&gt;|低维连续| E[Ax/BoTorch&lt;br/&gt;GP 精确建模]&#10;    B --&gt;|混合/条件| F[Optuna TPE&lt;br/&gt;或 Ax Hierarchical]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| G[Optuna TPE&lt;br/&gt;define-by-run]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| H{需要多目标/约束?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[Ax&lt;br/&gt;qNEHVI + constraints]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[Optuna 或 Ax&lt;br/&gt;均可]\">graph TD\n    A{评估次数预算?} --&gt;|&lt; 100 次| B{搜索空间复杂度?}\n    A --&gt;|100-1000 次| C{条件/离散参数多?}\n    A --&gt;|&gt; 1000 次| D[Optuna TPE&lt;br/&gt;低开销大规模]\n    B --&gt;|低维连续| E[Ax/BoTorch&lt;br/&gt;GP 精确建模]\n    B --&gt;|混合/条件| F[Optuna TPE&lt;br/&gt;或 Ax Hierarchical]\n    C --&gt;|是| G[Optuna TPE&lt;br/&gt;define-by-run]\n    C --&gt;|否| H{需要多目标/约束?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[Ax&lt;br/&gt;qNEHVI + constraints]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[Optuna 或 Ax&lt;br/&gt;均可]</pre><h2 id=\"与-ray-tune-的集成\">与 Ray Tune 的集成</h2><p>Ray Tune 作为分布式执行层，可以插入 Optuna 或 Ax 作为搜索算法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from ray import tune&#10;from ray.tune.search.optuna import OptunaSearch&#10;from ray.tune.schedulers import ASHAScheduler&#10;&#10;algo = OptunaSearch(sampler=optuna.samplers.TPESampler())&#10;scheduler = ASHAScheduler(max_t=100, grace_period=10, reduction_factor=3)&#10;&#10;tuner = tune.Tuner(&#10;    train_fn,&#10;    tune_config=tune.TuneConfig(&#10;        search_alg=algo,&#10;        scheduler=scheduler,&#10;        num_samples=200,&#10;        max_concurrent_trials=16&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;results = tuner.fit()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ray </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tune</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ray.tune.search.optuna </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OptunaSearch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ray.tune.schedulers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ASHAScheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">algo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OptunaSearch(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sampler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optuna.samplers.TPESampler())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ASHAScheduler(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">grace_period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reduction_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tuner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tune.Tuner(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    train_fn,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tune_config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tune.TuneConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        search_alg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">algo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        scheduler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        num_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        max_concurrent_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tuner.fit()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种分层架构的优势：搜索算法（Optuna/Ax）专注&quot;选什么配置&quot;，调度器（ASHA/PBT）专注&quot;资源怎么分&quot;，Ray 专注&quot;在哪执行&quot;——职责清晰、可独立替换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产环境最佳实践\">生产环境最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>存储选择</strong>：Optuna 生产环境推荐 PostgreSQL RDBStorage（支持并发写入、事务安全）；超大规模用 GrpcStorageProxy</li>\n<li><strong>断点续传</strong>：始终指定 <code>study_name</code> 和持久化存储，避免 crash 后丢失进度</li>\n<li><strong>资源隔离</strong>：每个 trial 的 GPU 内存应隔离（单独进程或容器），避免 OOM 级联</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性</strong>：Optuna Dashboard 提供实时 trial 进度、参数重要性、Pareto 前沿可视化；Ax 集成 TensorBoard</li>\n<li><strong>版本锁定</strong>：HPO 实验的复现性要求锁定 Optuna/Ax/BoTorch 版本和随机种子</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于<a href=\"neural-architecture-search\">神经架构搜索</a>等更大规模的设计空间优化，这些平台提供了必要的基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Optuna 和 Ax 代表了贝叶斯优化平台的两种设计哲学——轻量灵活 vs 全栈生产级。Optuna 以 TPE 为核心、define-by-run API 为特色，适合快速实验和复杂搜索空间；Ax 以 GP/BoTorch 为核心、GenerationStrategy 为编排层，适合多目标/约束/大规模生产部署。两者通过 Ray Tune 集成实现分布式执行，搜索算法和调度器的正交组合提供了最大灵活性。生产环境中持久化存储、断点续传和资源隔离是不可或缺的基础设施。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Optuna 与 Ax 平台","id":"optuna-与-ax-平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两大平台的定位差异","id":"两大平台的定位差异"},{"level":2,"text":"Optuna 核心用法","id":"optuna-核心用法"},{"level":3,"text":"基本优化循环","id":"基本优化循环"},{"level":3,"text":"进阶功能","id":"进阶功能"},{"level":2,"text":"Ax 核心用法","id":"ax-核心用法"},{"level":3,"text":"Service API（快速上手）","id":"service-api-快速上手"},{"level":3,"text":"Developer API（完全控制）","id":"developer-api-完全控制"},{"level":2,"text":"BoTorch：Ax 的优化引擎","id":"botorch-ax-的优化引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"平台选择决策树","id":"平台选择决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Ray Tune 的集成","id":"与-ray-tune-的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境最佳实践","id":"生产环境最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式并行搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/distributed-parallel-search"},"next":{"title":"神经架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/practice/neural-architecture-search"}}